<title>POLAND: SWARZEDZ TURNS TO LOSS IN MARCH.</title>
<headline>SWARZEDZ TURNS TO LOSS IN MARCH.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.23 vs   0.04 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.06 vs   0.05 profit</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.98 vs   1.15</p>
<p> Sales		    8.63 vs   9.66</p>
<p> JANUARY-MARCH	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.06 vs   0.13</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.50 vs   0.23</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.71 vs   3.32</p>
<p> Sales		   29.73 vs  26.40</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish furniture maker is Swarzedzkie</p>
<p>Fabryki Mebli Swarzedz SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
